## Why This Is Asked
Tests handling of differential privacy in a high-throughput, multi-tenant streaming system with per-tenant budgets and latency requirements.

## Key Concepts
- Differential privacy in streaming
- Per-tenant budget accounting and rollover
- Sliding window aggregations and latency SLAs
- Noise calibration (Gaussian) for min/max/median
- Data model and ledger design

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudocode: budget check and noise application
function processBatch(batch, tenantBudget) {
  const window = computeWeeklyWindow(batch, tenantBudget.tenantId);
  const stats = computeMinMaxMedian(window.values);
  const noisy = addGaussianNoise(stats, tenantBudget.epsilon, tenantBudget.delta);
  emit(tenantBudget.tenantId, noisy);
  tenantBudget.decrease(epsilonFrom(noisy));
}
```

