- How would you verify zero-downtime rotation across partitions?
- What tests would prove no cross-tenant leakage during rotation and access control checks?

## Why This Is Asked
Real-world KCNA deployments must tolerate broker failures while preserving delivery guarantees and avoiding duplicates during recovery. This question probes practical handling of offsets, in-flight state, and replay safety.

## Key Concepts
- Durable per-tenant commit logs
- In-flight state snapshots for unacked events
- Idempotent event processing with eventId deduplication
- Per-tenant replay guards and safe replay windows
- Chaos testing to validate recovery paths

## Code Example
